 </span><span begin="01:14.100" end="01:14.400">went </span><span begin="01:14.400" end="01:14.460">to </span><span begin="01:14.460" end="01:16.140">war</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.170" end="01:19.470"><span begin="01:16.170" end="01:16.620">Oh </span><span begin="01:16.620" end="01:17.040">yeah</span><span begin="01:17.040" end="01:17.040">, </span><span begin="01:17.040" end="01:17.310">you </span><span begin="01:17.310" end="01:17.460">are </span><span begin="01:17.460" end="01:17.580">my </span><span begin="01:17.580" end="01:19.470">sober</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.500" end="01:21.420"><span begin="01:19.500" end="01:20.280">When </span><span begin="01:20.280" end="01:20.460">I'm </span><span begin="01:20.460" end="01:20.640">on </span><span begin="01:20.640" end="01:20.700">the </span><span begin="01:20.700" end="01:21.420">floor</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.450" end="01:24.210"><span begin="01:21.450" end="01:21.870">Can't </span><span begin="01:21.870" end="01:22.920">see </span><span begin="01:22.920" end="01:23.310">when </span><span begin="01:23.310" end="01:23.400">I'm </span><span begin="01:23.400" end="01:24.210">falling</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.210" end="01:25.440"><span begin="01:24.210" end="01:24.660">Losing </span><span begin="01:24.660" end="01:25.440">myself</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.440" end="01:28.050"><span begin="01:25.440" end="01:25.770">But </span><span begin="01:25.770" end="01:26.100">then </span><span begin="01:26.100" end="01:26.250">I </span><span begin="01:26.250" end="01:26.340">hear </span><span begin="01:26.340" end="01:26.550">you </span><span begin="01:26.550" end="01:28.050">calling</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.110" end="01:29.700"><span begin="01:28.110" end="01:28.770">There </span><span begin="01:28.770" end="01:29.040">you </span><span begin="01:29.040" end="01:29.700">are</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.700" end="01:31.740"><span b